flowchart TD
    A([Publish starts]) --> B[Client publishes RTMP through public Proxy Service]
    B --> C[Proxy receives stream]
    C --> D[on_publish_start.sh notifies POST /streams/started]
    D --> E{Current owner?}
    E -->|None or same Proxy| F[Register or refresh Proxy ownership]
    E -->|Different Proxy| G{Old owner unhealthy or stream absent from /stats?}
    G -->|No| H[Reject handover with HTTP 409]
    G -->|Yes| I[Increment generation and transfer ownership]
    F --> J[Persist ownership-only state]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Return registered or idempotent_replay]

    K --> L[Proxy health reconciliation every 3s with jitter]
    L --> M{Failure threshold reached?}
    M -->|No| L
    M -->|Yes| N[Expire streams owned by unhealthy Proxy]
    N --> O[Persist ownership-only state]

    K --> P([Publish continues])
    P --> Q[on_publish_done.sh notifies POST /streams/ended]
    Q --> R{Owner and generation still match?}
    R -->|No| S[Return stale_event_ignored]
    R -->|Yes| T[Remove owner, registry entry, and generation]
    T --> U[Persist state and return ended]
    U --> V([End])

    W[No Worker provisioning, mapping, health reconciliation, or deletion]:::note
    J -. cleanup-phase boundary .-> W
    classDef note fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404,color:#533f03
